# Testing

## Unit (`src/test/java/.../ut/`)
- JUnit 5 + Mockito; mirror production package under `ut/`
- Run: `make test`

## Integration (`src/test/java/.../it/`)
- Cucumber + Testcontainers (MySQL, Redis, Kafka)
- Glue packages: `com.olx.boilerplate.it.config` + `it.stepdefinition` (siblings, not parent+child)
- Features: `src/test/resources/features_and_scenarios/`
- Background must set host: `Given I have http://0.0.0.0:8080/ host`
- Path steps use regex in CommonRestStepDefinitions, not `{string}` for unquoted paths
- `init-it.sql` must include tables used at runtime (incl. `outbox_event`)
- Profile `integration-test` disables outbox relay; uses dynamic Redis port
- Run: `make it` (Docker required)

## After test changes
- Unit only → `make test`
- IT/features/CucumberSpringConfiguration → `make it`
